└── Unit/
```

## Conventions

- Controllers → FormRequest (validates + authorizes) → Service/Action → response
- Mass-assignment guarded: always set `$fillable` explicitly (never rely on `$guarded = []`)
- Eloquent relationships typed with return types (Laravel 10+); avoid N+1 via `->with(...)`
- `config()` reads only in bootstrap; runtime code receives injected config
- Secrets via `.env` → `config()`; never `env()` in runtime code (breaks `config:cache`)
- Jobs are idempotent — retries must not double-charge, double-email, double-write
- Policies for authorization; `$this->authorize('update', $model)` in controllers

## Important

- [CUSTOMIZE] `.env.example` structure; PHP version via `php -v`
- Run `php artisan config:cache && php artisan route:cache && php artisan view:cache` in prod deploy
- NEVER `migrate:fresh` or `db:wipe` against production
- `APP_DEBUG=false` and `APP_ENV=production` are mandatory in prod
- CSRF tokens on all non-GET HTML forms; Sanctum/Passport for API auth
